# Ownership split for The Agentic Brief.
#
# content/brief/** is written by the newsletter pipeline in the feed repo and
# arrives as an automated pull request. It is listed here so those PRs still get
# a named reviewer rather than merging with nobody accountable for them.
#
# TODO: once the pipeline gets its own machine identity (a fine-grained PAT or a
# GitHub App named brief-bot), point these lines at that account's team so
# generated commits are filterable and the human owner is the reviewer, not the
# author.
content/brief/**        @yadneshSalvi

# Hand-written content and everything that renders it stays human-owned.
content/posts/**        @yadneshSalvi
content/series/**       @yadneshSalvi
src/**                  @yadneshSalvi
scripts/**              @yadneshSalvi
